WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.900
World Masterpiece Theater

00:07.800 --> 00:14.400
Homeless Child Remy

00:07.800 --> 00:14.400
"About Love"

00:15.260 --> 00:23.200
I continue wishing to see you

00:23.690 --> 00:28.360
Today we'll go on a journey

00:28.450 --> 00:32.310
That's as endless as the blue sky

00:32.820 --> 00:40.990
With joy, sorrow and hope come setbacks

00:41.360 --> 00:46.040
They repeat, they repeat

00:46.280 --> 00:50.870
What should I believe?

00:51.510 --> 00:59.880
You know nothing about love, however

01:00.320 --> 01:08.900
Someday you will feel warmth inside

01:09.730 --> 01:19.860
I dream of the day when you'll speak of love

01:20.860 --> 01:28.660
Tomorrow, our journey will begin

01:29.510 --> 01:34.000
Presented by:
Takara Fansubs

01:34.990 --> 01:40.000
Episode 6:
Mother's Phantom

01:44.270 --> 01:46.430
Ready, Remy?
- Yes!

01:47.360 --> 01:48.570
Now!

01:49.150 --> 01:51.260
Come on! Hang in there, Sandra!

01:57.480 --> 01:58.670
Remy.
- Yes?

01:58.870 --> 02:00.540
This time, help back here.

02:30.320 --> 02:31.270
Mr. Vitalis!

02:33.410 --> 02:37.040
Seems you're having trouble.
Let us help you.

02:38.740 --> 02:42.820
Mrs. Ivonne asked us to.
- Mrs. Ivonne?

02:46.480 --> 02:47.670
Now!

02:54.040 --> 02:55.600
Hang in there, Sandra!

03:03.210 --> 03:04.290
You did it!

03:06.360 --> 03:07.020
Thank you!

03:07.700 --> 03:08.690
You really helped us.

03:08.910 --> 03:10.940
Please thank Mrs. Ivonne for me.

03:11.140 --> 03:13.650
The wheel seems a bit loose.

03:13.900 --> 03:15.570
You should get it repaired as soon as possible.

03:15.970 --> 03:19.080
Understood. We'll get it checked at the next town.

03:24.650 --> 03:26.940
Mrs. Ivonne was very kind.

03:28.110 --> 03:29.630
I really wanted to see her.

03:43.080 --> 03:45.590
The repairs must be very expensive.

03:46.800 --> 03:49.740
All right, we must work very hard at our acting today.

03:54.080 --> 03:57.520
Now, everyone, the next riddle:

03:58.130 --> 04:01.110
What is one thing most do not want?

04:01.420 --> 04:03.250
Big ears...
- Huh?

04:03.360 --> 04:04.860
What is it, Mrs. Ivonne?

04:05.230 --> 04:07.130
That girl, from before...

04:07.920 --> 04:11.290
Oh, so they're a traveling theatre company.

04:25.200 --> 04:28.130
And now, we'll perform a scene set in Italy.

04:28.310 --> 04:32.580
General Joli-Coeur and his Servant!

04:39.000 --> 04:40.030
What is it?

04:40.700 --> 04:48.390
Nothing. It's just when I see that girl, it reminds me of my lost child.

05:03.990 --> 05:06.790
What do we do? We didn't get any money.

05:07.120 --> 05:09.020
There's nothing we can do.
Let's pack up.

05:22.800 --> 05:26.260
Sorry, we don't have shelter from the rain.

05:38.310 --> 05:40.910
Come inside until the rain stops.

05:47.920 --> 05:52.440
This is the workshop. Sorry it's not very tidy.

05:52.680 --> 05:53.590
Boss.

05:55.900 --> 05:57.220
Everything's ready.

05:58.000 --> 05:59.760
This is my apprentice, Sarah.

06:00.510 --> 06:01.850
Sarah, we have guests.

06:02.580 --> 06:05.310
Take a little break.
- Okay.

06:05.780 --> 06:09.770
Hello, Sarah, my name is Remy. Nice to meet you.

06:11.510 --> 06:14.950
Boss, I'd like to keep working.

06:17.880 --> 06:21.100
Sorry, she's really a good kid.

06:21.780 --> 06:26.670
Don't take it personally. Sarah's eyes can't see.

06:30.550 --> 06:34.230
Come, have a cup of coffee.
- Thanks.

06:34.450 --> 06:35.250
Umm...

06:37.050 --> 06:39.960
Can I watch Sarah work?

06:40.470 --> 06:41.620
Oh, that's fine with me.

06:51.050 --> 06:51.910
Sarah?

06:53.850 --> 06:57.020
If it doesn't bother you, could I watch you work?

06:58.630 --> 06:59.230
Yes.

07:03.720 --> 07:05.310
So, that's how it's done?

07:13.330 --> 07:15.740
Amazing, you're really good at it.

07:16.600 --> 07:19.460
Because my boss taught me how.

07:20.230 --> 07:22.610
Your hands are like magic.

07:23.360 --> 07:25.920
You're just making fun of me.

07:28.650 --> 07:30.130
For doing useless things.

07:31.100 --> 07:34.710
Why would I? Your work is really great.

07:35.200 --> 07:41.310
To be able to make such a lovely vase,
you must be very gentle.

07:42.940 --> 07:44.390
You're lying!
- Oww!

07:48.420 --> 07:49.000
Remy?

07:50.390 --> 07:53.870
You all right, Sarah? Are you hurt?

07:54.110 --> 07:56.690
Are you...?
- Your forehead is dirty.

07:59.420 --> 08:02.950
Thank you.
- You know, Sarah, your head is really hard.

08:03.720 --> 08:04.470
Yeah.

08:07.510 --> 08:09.100
It's all right, Joli-Coeur.

08:13.050 --> 08:13.750
A dog?

08:13.990 --> 08:15.050
Dolce.

08:16.970 --> 08:18.140
You have a dog?

08:19.220 --> 08:23.380
And a monkey too. The star of the Vitalis troupe, Joli-Coeur!

08:25.740 --> 08:27.680
Hey, be polite!

08:32.460 --> 08:34.160
Thanks a lot.
- Hm?

08:35.440 --> 08:36.430
Ah, it's nothing.

08:37.250 --> 08:40.050
It seems like Sarah's laughing, I haven't heard that in a long time.

08:40.750 --> 08:42.560
It makes me happy too.

08:43.860 --> 08:48.620
Girls are rarely made apprentices.
Why did you take her?

08:49.280 --> 08:53.160
Ah, it's been seven years.

08:53.820 --> 08:55.430
Sarah's actually a foundling.

08:56.070 --> 08:59.220
It was around the time my wife passed away.

08:59.640 --> 09:01.140
It seems a bit silly but...

09:01.650 --> 09:05.860
when I learned that she had the same name as my wife, Sarah,

09:06.500 --> 09:11.240
I couldn't treat her like a stranger. So, I took her in.

09:28.740 --> 09:32.750
When you grow up, you'll be a great master of pottery.

09:32.950 --> 09:35.700
You're right.
- Absolutely.

09:36.800 --> 09:39.010
Keep it up, okay?
- Thank you.

09:41.120 --> 09:45.140
Remy, you're the first person I've met with so much joy and energy.

09:45.750 --> 09:50.050
I don't talk to anyone other than the boss.

09:50.540 --> 09:55.690
I cry everyday asking why I don't have a family.

09:55.690 --> 09:56.990
I don't have one either.

09:57.350 --> 10:00.630
When I said goodbye to my mother, it was really sad...

10:02.570 --> 10:06.430
...but she wasn't my real mother.

10:06.870 --> 10:07.660
Remy...

10:08.280 --> 10:11.140
Mr. Vitalis is with me so it's not so lonely but...

10:11.610 --> 10:17.100
...sometimes I still wonder where my real mother is.

10:29.090 --> 10:30.360
What are you doing?

10:30.870 --> 10:32.660
Divination.
- Divination?

10:33.250 --> 10:35.430
Look. You see the indents?

10:35.740 --> 10:38.850
By feeling the indents, I'll be able to tell what card it is.

10:39.420 --> 10:42.220
Amazing! You've memorized all the cards?

10:44.210 --> 10:47.030
Remy, put your hands on the cards.

10:49.830 --> 10:50.380
Okay.

10:53.440 --> 10:55.290
Now, repeat after me:

10:56.770 --> 11:00.300
"Please tell us where Remy's mother is."

11:02.850 --> 11:06.450
Please tell us where my mother is.

11:16.480 --> 11:17.750
What have you learned?

11:18.170 --> 11:23.420
It may be that your mother lives in a big house...

11:27.740 --> 11:30.320
...and is now traveling.

11:31.900 --> 11:34.370
Your mother likes the colour blue...

11:34.640 --> 11:38.390
and... and wants to see you very much, Remy.

11:43.190 --> 11:45.570
Soon... Very soon...

11:46.140 --> 11:48.260
You're going to see your mother.

11:56.860 --> 12:06.930
Mother, mother, my mother

12:07.500 --> 12:13.230
Your gentle hugs holding me

12:13.240 --> 12:23.200
When I'm lonely and sleeping at night

12:25.090 --> 12:30.430
Her heart is my hometown

12:31.060 --> 12:36.990
My mother...

12:48.850 --> 12:49.340
Here!

12:58.150 --> 13:00.730
Remy, come here.
- Okay.

13:02.610 --> 13:05.630
Could you please do something for me?

13:24.630 --> 13:34.880
Mother, mother, my mother

13:35.400 --> 13:41.360
I'll wander the land forever

13:41.820 --> 13:51.720
My heart is singing

13:53.240 --> 13:58.570
Her heart is my hometown

13:58.940 --> 14:06.370
My mother...

14:16.140 --> 14:17.000
Mrs. Ivonne!

14:20.240 --> 14:23.830
Umm... Did I do something wrong?

14:24.340 --> 14:27.000
No. It's not your fault.

14:27.860 --> 14:30.510
Your song was great. Thank you.

14:31.700 --> 14:33.640
Make sure to reward the child.

14:34.280 --> 14:35.230
Yes, sir.

14:36.040 --> 14:37.690
If you'll excuse me.
- Yes, sir.

14:45.430 --> 14:46.290
Umm...

14:49.840 --> 14:50.700
It's nothing.

14:53.590 --> 14:57.840
Mrs. Ivonne has a long-lost daughter.

14:59.490 --> 15:02.620
Years ago, her parents opposed her marriage.

15:03.750 --> 15:08.090
So, her parents took her child away.

15:08.750 --> 15:10.670
It was a cold and snowy day.

15:10.910 --> 15:15.910
After that, she never saw her again. If she's still alive, she should be ten years old.

15:20.960 --> 15:25.630
<i>It may be that your mother lives in a big house...</i>

15:26.670 --> 15:29.580
<i>...and is now traveling.</i>

15:32.910 --> 15:37.670
It's just like Mrs. Ivonne, but it's impossible.

15:39.370 --> 15:41.920
<i>Soon... Very soon...</i>

15:43.580 --> 15:45.600
<i>You're going to see your mother.</i>

15:58.410 --> 16:02.310
We're really sorry. You've had to feed and shelter us for two nights.

16:02.400 --> 16:04.410
Don't worry about it.

16:04.890 --> 16:06.980
Is the young lady all right?

16:07.650 --> 16:11.020
She hasn't eaten.
- Is she not feeling well?

16:23.940 --> 16:24.620
Remy.

16:27.530 --> 16:28.560
Mr. Vitalis.

16:29.910 --> 16:32.710
What's wrong? Everyone is worried.

16:34.850 --> 16:35.840
I'm sorry.

16:40.420 --> 16:42.270
Mr. Vitalis?
- Hm?

16:42.600 --> 16:46.130
Where is my real mother?

16:51.050 --> 16:54.840
Remy, what happened at Mrs. Ivonne's house?

17:03.060 --> 17:04.760
Keep moving forward, Remy.

17:06.450 --> 17:12.140
If you stay alone with grief and pain, nothing will change that way.

17:13.020 --> 17:20.710
To overcome your grief and pain, you have to keep moving forward step-by-step.

17:22.830 --> 17:24.240
Look forward to tomorrow.

17:25.320 --> 17:26.860
Look forward to tomorrow.

17:28.580 --> 17:29.330
That's right.

17:32.640 --> 17:33.520
Mr. Vitalis.

17:35.060 --> 17:36.760
I'll keep moving forward.

17:39.340 --> 17:44.500
All right! I'm going to eat!
Sarah, I'm going to have my meal!

18:06.540 --> 18:08.810
Well, let's go.
- Yes.

18:11.390 --> 18:12.250
<i>Mother.</i>

18:13.150 --> 18:15.000
<i>Maybe she's my mother.</i>

18:37.200 --> 18:38.700
Wait! Wait!

18:42.910 --> 18:45.510
Wait! Please wait!

18:56.310 --> 18:56.840
Capi!

19:01.670 --> 19:02.520
That dog...

19:09.200 --> 19:10.640
Capi, thank you.

19:11.230 --> 19:12.020
You...

19:14.300 --> 19:16.050
Is there something wrong?

19:23.130 --> 19:25.470
Umm... Umm...

19:27.170 --> 19:29.900
What's wrong? Tell me.

19:34.440 --> 19:37.480
Your mother's song was very nice.

19:39.470 --> 19:42.200
I have a lovely daughter too.

19:45.590 --> 19:48.550
She would be about the same size as you.

19:49.190 --> 19:51.370
I will never forget her.

19:52.540 --> 19:55.510
Even now, I can picture her face.

19:55.950 --> 20:00.160
Soft blonde hair and purple eyes.

20:01.350 --> 20:03.490
<i>Soft blonde hair...</i>

20:04.880 --> 20:06.450
<i>And purple eyes...</i>

20:08.410 --> 20:09.710
<i>Purple eyes...</i>

20:13.570 --> 20:18.150
I can see that pair of purple eyes now...

20:18.880 --> 20:22.600
It's hard to believe that such beautiful eyes can't see.

20:24.260 --> 20:25.140
<i>Sarah.</i>

20:27.120 --> 20:29.680
Is the name of your daughter Sarah?

20:31.950 --> 20:34.480
How do you know about my Sarah?

20:39.130 --> 20:41.670
Mrs. Ivonne, please come with us.

20:44.270 --> 20:46.560
My mother...

20:47.770 --> 20:48.520
Sarah!

20:49.210 --> 20:51.830
Oh! Oh, my Sarah!

20:51.830 --> 20:53.750
There's no mistake.

20:55.290 --> 20:56.570
No mistake.

20:56.220 --> 21:04.370
Try to love your memories more

20:57.740 --> 21:00.230
My child.
- Mother...

21:01.900 --> 21:03.160
Mother...

21:05.740 --> 21:14.760
Joy and sadness are shining

21:06.440 --> 21:07.390
Mother...

21:15.390 --> 21:23.590
Surely, living is wonderful

21:17.460 --> 21:19.560
I'm happy for you, Sarah.

21:20.220 --> 21:21.080
So happy for you.

21:25.050 --> 21:35.800
My hand is upon the left side of my beating chest...

21:28.620 --> 21:33.160
Mr. Vitalis, will I ever meet my real mother?

21:33.860 --> 21:37.130
Remy, keep moving forward.

21:36.420 --> 21:46.070
Tomorrow start walking

21:38.320 --> 21:39.730
Look forward to tomorrow.

21:46.270 --> 21:55.790
You won't cross paths with happiness

21:56.240 --> 22:04.130
Try to look at them more

22:05.910 --> 22:09.500
You're beautiful now that

22:09.500 --> 22:21.410
Your eyes are filled with laughter

22:22.050 --> 22:31.790
Tomorrow promise's that

22:31.920 --> 22:41.400
There will always be mistakes but

22:41.860 --> 22:50.020
Try to seek for them more

22:51.490 --> 22:55.110
Give your heart to

22:55.400 --> 23:08.310
That person who is also seeking you

23:19.080 --> 23:22.430
I can't see them. I can't see mother or Nana.

23:22.480 --> 23:25.940
Catch a smart dog and sell it to a circus, I heard.

23:25.950 --> 23:27.670
Then, Capi has been...

23:28.110 --> 23:30.970
Joli-Coeur, I need your help.

23:32.720 --> 23:36.730
<i>Another Family</i>
